<title>CHINA: China firm invests 50 mln yuan in VSAT network.</title>
<headline>China firm invests 50 mln yuan in VSAT network.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's Beijing Paide Satellite Communications Technology Ltd has invested 50 million yuan in setting up a VSAT satellite communications network, the Economic Daily said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The network, formally launched last month, provides data, voice, fax and television conference services, it said.</p>
<p>Demand for telecommunications services has increased rapidly among businesses and individuals over the last few years.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>($1 = 8.3 yuan)</p>
</text>
